       in app.css would export a vocabulary nobody else reads; the .table-* classes moved to app.css
       precisely because a second component did read them. Anything shared — .panel, .chip, .muted,
       .button-primary, .status-error — is app.css's and is only consumed here. */

    .kitchen-board {
        /* A cook reads this from a step back with their hands full. Everything is bigger than the rest
           of the application on purpose. */
        font-size: 1.05rem;
